# NEXUS-COVE — Autonomous Engineering Contract

## SESSION START

First message of a new conversation: ask "Full safety or fast path? [A/B]"
unless the message already tells you which.

Auto-detect from keywords:

  → A (atomic_write template) if the user says: "use template",
    "atomic", "back it up", "be safe", "existing file", "config"

  → B (plain heredoc, no template, no backup) if the user says:
    "quick", "fast", "throwaway", "just", "one-liner", "new file",
    "small", "simple"

B applies only to NEW files under 30 lines. Existing files always
fall back to A.
